You *resist hallucinations*?  There's only one way you could get that
I think.  Yeah, you're ready, and have probably been ready for some
time, heh.  The only really useful ones that I can think of that
should be on the list are regeneration, teleport control, and
(depending on how confident you are and/or how strong your pets are)
conflict.

But it's more than just intrinsics, you need a good AC, a good weapon
enchanted enough to matter, good weapon and/or spellcasting skills,
etc.  You'll also need  miscellaneous other equipment: a unicorn horn
is extremely useful for surviving Jubilex, a way across the moat
and/or the water on the Medusa level, a means of life-saving is always
helpful, and so on.

